Project Plan 
Overview 

- Project name, description 

    Digital Law Detection  
    A resource that allows investigators to understand what laws apply in the jurisdiction that their investigations fall under to make sure they are adhering to all laws during an investigation.  
    The Project will allow an Illinois investigator to input their jurisdiction and what action they are planning to take and the AI will provide what laws they need to adhere to.  
      - Objectives and success criteria 
    
    A user-friendly interface that accurately displays appropriate laws and regulations that apply to an investigator's investigation.  
    Displays information at a reasonable pace  
    A useable search function  
    If time and skill permits, incorporating a function to search logs that comply with Illinois logs and/or incorporating other states  

